sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User UI
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant PB as Publishing
    participant BL as Billing
    participant Q as Queue
    participant W as Publish Worker
    participant V as Token Vault
    participant AD as Channel Adapter
    participant SN as Social Network

    U->>GW: POST /publications (version -> channels)
    GW->>PB: create job
    PB->>BL: checkEntitlements
    BL-->>PB: ok
    PB-->>U: 202 job_id + SSE status stream
    PB->>Q: enqueue attempts per channel
    W->>Q: take attempt
    W->>V: get ephemeral credentials
    V-->>W: token
    W->>AD: publish(payload, idempotencyKey)
    AD->>SN: API call
    alt success
        SN-->>AD: post id/url
        AD-->>W: succeeded
        W->>PB: attempt.succeeded -> aggregate job
    else transient error
        SN-->>AD: 429 / 5xx
        AD-->>W: retryable
        W->>Q: requeue with backoff
    else permanent error
        SN-->>AD: 401 revoked
        AD-->>W: failed
        W->>PB: attempt.failed, connection=reauth_required
    end
